/ActualText (About me\n\nUX/UI Designer with over 8 years of professional experience across different areas, complemented by education in Visual Arts, Graphic Design, and UX/UI Design.\n\nI combine creative thinking with analytical skills, problem-solving abilities, and strong attention to detail. Passionate about creating intuitive, accessible, and user-centred digital experiences, I aim to translate user needs into clear, functional, and visually engaging design solutions.\n\nOrganised, proactive, and detail-oriented, I am comfortable working independently, managing multiple tasks, and continuously developing my design skills. Proficient in Figma and familiar with digital design tools and collaborative workflows.\n\n)
